The [[Mana Orb]] is an epic [[accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. It generates {{icon/mana}} proportional to the amount of triggers occurring at its corners, and is one of the most efficient methods of doing so. It is also used in the creation of {{icon/mana}}-based [[weapon]]s and other items, some of which spend {{icon/mana}}, and some of which generate it. If a large amount of {{icon/mana}} is reached, the [[Mana Orb]] uses 35 {{icon/mana}} and generates 20 non-{{icon/mana}} buffs. This aspect is enhanced by the [[Mana Mastery]] [[skill]].

Gaining {{icon/mana}} from [[Mana Orb]] does not count as an activation. Using {{icon/mana}} to gain [[buff]]s does count as an activation.

The [[Mana Orb]] is generally important for any {{icon/mana}}-based build, as it can generate a lot of {{icon/mana}} when placed next to fast-triggering items, and is also part of some very {{icon/mana}}-synergistic crafts, including all Staves (starting with [[Magic Staff]]), [[Manathirst]], and [[Spectral Dagger]], along with the [[Moon Armor]] and [[Moon Shield]].

